<Base title="About — Matthew McMahon" description="College hooper, lifelong builder, chasing a purposeful life on his own terms.">
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Built like a human.</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Matt McMahon — an Irish-Catholic kid from outside Philadelphia. College hooper, lifelong creative,
      someone who knows a little about a lot and is on a mission to build a purposeful life and help other
      people do the same.
    </p>
    <p>
      I did everything right on paper. Good grades, good college, the job pipeline. Then I pulled one thread
      on how money actually works — and the whole story came apart. The schools, the "right answers," the
      map I'd been handed. Once you see it, you can't unsee it.
    </p>
    <p>
      So now I write it down and build the tools to live differently. If you want to master yourself, do
      creative work, and own your life instead of renting it — this is for you.
    </p>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-faint)">Play. Believe. Pursue.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
